{"hw":"χρησμός","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">χρησμός</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">χρησμός</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">ὁ</span>, (<span class=\"gk\">χράω</span> (B) A) <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">oracular response, oracle,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pi.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">P.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.60</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">SIG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1044.49</span> </span> (Halic., <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">iv/iii B. C.</span>), etc.; <span class=\"gk\">χ. ἀσήμους δυσκρίτως τ' εἰρημένους</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Pr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">662</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἔχρης' Ἀδράστῳ Αοξίας χρησμόν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ph.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">409</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">σφι χρησμὸν ἔφαινε</span> delivered <b class=\"lex-tr\">an oracle</b> to them, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.159</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ᾄδειν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.21</span> </span> (cf. <span class=\"gk\">χρησμῳδός</span>)<span class=\"gk\">; εὔτεκνοι χ.</span> promising happy progeny, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ion</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">424</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">χ. ἔμμετρος</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Plu.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.396c</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">καταλογάδην τοὺς χ. λέγειν</span> ib. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">397d</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">χρησμὸς.. περαίνεται</span> is fulfilled, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ph.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1703</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">χρησμοῦ ὄντος.. τὴν πόλιν διαφθαρῆναι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">R.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">415c</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ὥσπερ χρησμοὺς γράψαντες,</span> i. e. with all solemnity, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Lycurg.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">92</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Isoc.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.171</span> </span>.</div></div>"}